The Opportunity &nbsp;

Digital marketing has been fundamentally restructured by AI - and we need a leader who doesn't just understand that shift, but is actively shaping it. This is not a role for someone catching up; it's for someone who's already operating in the new paradigm. &nbsp;

As Senior Director of Digital Marketing, you will own AvePoint's end-to-end digital presence and performance - from how we're discovered by AI answer engines to how we convert pipeline on the website. You'll lead SEO/GEO, Answer Engine Optimization (AEO), paid media, and web conversion strategy, building a fully AI-powered digital org that stays ahead of the curve on every front. &nbsp;

What You'll Own &nbsp;

Answer Engine Optimization (AEO) &amp; GEO &nbsp;

