• Expand central JLR campaign assets into effective market and channel executions while protecting the original idea, brand&nbsp;consistency&nbsp;and Modern Luxury standards.&nbsp;

• Develop creative recommendations informed by the audience, media placement, local culture, seasonality, market&nbsp;context&nbsp;and campaign&nbsp;objective, ensuring activation is more than resizing or mechanical versioning.&nbsp;

• Work as part of a three-person activation team with a designer and writer, collaborating closely to shape coherent visual, verbal and channel-specific solutions.&nbsp;

• Create and adapt source files, layouts, storyboards and motion or film executions, including duration changes and reframing that preserve meaning,&nbsp;pace&nbsp;and impact.&nbsp;

• Respond creatively to high-value and non-standard media opportunities, including premium large-format out-of-home and airport takeovers, making the best possible use of scale, environment, dwell&nbsp;time&nbsp;and viewing&nbsp;behaviour.&nbsp;

• Partner with the Creative Craft Lead, central creative teams, media partners and local-market stakeholders to understand briefs, challenge assumptions and find practical solutions at pace.&nbsp;

